## 🎮 Neon Orchard — Complete

**Summary:** Neon Orchard is now playable — a neon-noir orchard where you slide a woven basket (←/→ or A/D, drag/touch) to catch glowing fruit (+10 peach, +12 grape, +15 star, +20 apple, combo bonus) and dodge rocks (−1 life). Includes score/best/level HUD, 3 lives with hearts, shake/flash/invuln feedback, floating +score, combo xN, level banner, intensity meter, and start/pause/game-over flow with restart. Self-contained single-file `index.html` (no build, ~830 lines) with WebAudio bleeps, particles, and responsive layout (desktop + mobile touch zones).

**Public game link:** Open directly — https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/340d5f70d4d59028afc3eebf32a33771384d7fdd/index.html (or `http://localhost:3000` via tmux `app-server`). Repo path: https://github.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/blob/340d5f70d4d59028afc3eebf32a33771384d7fdd/index.html

**Final commit:** https://github.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/commit/340d5f70d4d59028afc3eebf32a33771384d7fdd
- `11e3776` feat: initial game
- `340d5f7` fix: TDZ basket-before-resize + browser verification

**Deployment and test status:**
- ✅ `tmux` session `app-server` running `python3 -m http.server 3000` — serving `http://localhost:3000` (verified `curl 200`, `ss -tulpn` shows python3 on 3000)
- ✅ Browser tests (Playwright 1.62.1, Chromium 151): ALL PASS — title, canvas, HUD (score/best/hearts/level), start overlay visible, play click hides overlay + running=true, spawn items after 2.2s, basket moves right ArrowRight + left A, pause/resume, mobile responsive 375px
